<title>USA: Prime Bancorp to merge with First Sterling.</title>
<headline>Prime Bancorp to merge with First Sterling.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Bancorp Inc said it had gained approval from the Federal Reserve to acquire First Sterling Bancorp Inc of Devon, Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>It said it had also got permission to transfer its offices to Pennsylvania by merging into a newly-formed holding company.</p>
<p>Prime Bancorp said it expected to complete the merger by December 31, creating an entity with more than $900 million in assets.</p>
</text>
